  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8170.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Kids&amp;Us, school of english, en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 de Onda, ha finalizado este viernes la tercera Summer Fun Week, en la que se combinan las clases sobre un tema determinado con salidas al parque contiguo o actividades pr&aacute;cticas, como el mercado (Market).</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek1.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek10.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek11.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek12.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek13.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek14.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsummerfunweekkidsampus/3erdsummerfunweek15.jpg\" alt=\"3erdsummerfunweek15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erdsu